  "title": "Kofta Kebabs",
  "description": "Kofta made with ground lamb and aromatic spices, shaped into kebabs and grilled. Serve with pita and yogurt dressing for a delicious Middle Eastern meal.",
  "authors": [
    "SRKELZ"
  ],
